# Vendored NVIDIA Labs research repos (4D-RGPT, SpatialClaw) + their third-party
# perception models (Depth-Anything-3, SAM3, Pi3, L4P). Code + docs are tracked;
# the heavy demo media (videos/gifs/sample data) below is excluded to keep the
# git repo lean — re-fetch with `git submodule update --init --recursive` inside
# each vendored repo if you ever need the original demos.
research/external/**/*.mp4
research/external/**/*.gif
research/external/**/*.npz
research/external/**/*.pth
research/external/**/*.safetensors
research/external/**/*.ckpt
research/external/SpatialClaw/tools/third_party/Pi3/examples/
research/external/SpatialClaw/tools/third_party/sam3/assets/
research/external/4D-RGPT/third_party/L4P/media/
research/external/4D-RGPT/teaser_4D-RGPT.png
